'''''Cyrtomium fortunei''''', also known by its common name '''Fortune's holly-fern''', is a [[species]] from the genus ''[[Cyrtomium]]''.<ref name="inaturalist-Cyrtomium fortunei">{{cite web |title=Cyrtomium fortunei |url=https://www.inaturalist.org/taxa/161570-Cyrtomium-fortunei |website=iNaturalist |access-date=2020-12-12 |language=en}}{{Circular reference|date=November 2023}}</ref> This plant was first described by [[John Smith (botanist)|John Smith]].<ref>{{Citation|last=Registry-Migration.Gbif.Org|title=GBIF Backbone Taxonomy|date=2019|url=https://www.gbif.org/dataset/d7dddbf4-2cf0-4f39-9b2a-bb099caae36c|publisher=GBIF Secretariat|language=en|doi=10.15468/39omei|access-date=2020-12-15}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Smith, John {{!}} International Plant Names Index|url=https://www.ipni.org/a/9805-1|access-date=2020-12-15|website=www.ipni.org}}</ref> It has gained the [[Royal Horticultural Society]]'s [[Award of Garden Merit]].<ref>{{cite web|title=''Cyrtomium fortunei'' Fortune's cyrtomium |url=https://www.rhs.org.uk/Plants/22791/Cyrtomium-fortunei/Details |publisher=The Royal Horticultural Society |accessdate=22 December 2020 }}</ref>

